<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>SPICE — Galaxy statistics during reionisation</title>
<style>
:root{--bg:#f5f1ea;--ink:#1d1a17;--muted:#746d64;--accent:#9a8471;--line:rgba(29,26,23,0.08);--radius:14px}
*{box-sizing:border-box} html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{margin:0;font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);line-height:1.75}
h1,h2,h3{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin-top:0}
a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
.container{max-width:1100px;margin:auto;padding:2rem}
nav{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:4rem;font-size:.95rem}
nav .left a,nav .right a{color:var(--muted);margin-left:1.2rem} nav .left a:first-child{margin-left:0} nav a:hover{color:var(--ink)}
.kicker{font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:.8rem}
.status{display:inline-block;font-size:.74rem;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--accent);margin-bottom:1rem}
.hero{margin-bottom:6rem}
.hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:2rem;align-items:end}
.hero h1{font-size:4rem;line-height:1.02;max-width:11ch;margin-bottom:1rem}
.hero-intro,.text,.caption{color:var(--muted)} .hero-intro{max-width:58ch;font-size:1.05rem}
.hero-meta{padding-top:1rem;border-top:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem} .hero-meta div{margin-bottom:.6rem}
.hero-media{margin-top:2.5rem;border-radius:var(--radius);overflow:hidden;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ddd,#eee);min-height:420px}
.hero-media img,.hero-media video{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block}
.section{margin-bottom:6rem} .section h2{font-size:2.2rem;margin-bottom:1rem} .text{max-width:700px}
.media-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.3fr 1fr;gap:1rem;margin-top:2rem}
.media-stack{display:grid;gap:1rem}
.media-frame{overflow:hidden;border-radius:var(--radius);background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ddd,#eee);min-height:240px}
.media-frame.tall{min-height:500px}
.media-frame img,.media-frame video{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;transition:transform .8s ease}
.media-frame:hover img,.media-frame:hover video{transform:scale(1.03)}
.caption{font-size:.84rem;margin-top:.45rem}
.result-list{margin-top:1.5rem}
.result-item{padding:1rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.result-item strong{display:block;margin-bottom:.25rem;font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:1.15rem}
.links{display:grid;gap:.8rem;max-width:500px;margin-top:1.5rem}
.links a{color:var(--muted);border-bottom:1px solid transparent;width:fit-content;transition:.2s ease}
.links a:hover{color:var(--accent);border-bottom-color:var(--accent)}
.fade-in{opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px);transition:opacity .9s ease, transform .9s ease}
.fade-in.visible{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}
@media(max-width:900px){.hero-grid,.media-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr} .hero h1{font-size:2.9rem;max-width:none} .hero-media{min-height:300px} .media-frame.tall{min-height:280px}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
<nav>
  <div class="left"><a href="index.html">← SPICE</a></div>
  <div class="right"><a href="#overview">Overview</a><a href="#visuals">Visuals</a><a href="#results">Results</a><a href="#links">Links</a></div>
</nav>
<section class="hero fade-in">
  <div class="hero-grid">
    <div>
      <div class="kicker">SPICE / Project page</div>
      <div class="status">Published project</div>
      <h1>Galaxy statistics during reionisation</h1>
      <p class="hero-intro">This project gathers the main galaxy population statistics produced by SPICE, linking internal galaxy growth to observable quantities such as UV luminosities, stellar masses, and star-formation histories.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-meta">
      <div><strong>Theme</strong> · galaxy populations and observables</div>
      <div><strong>Scope</strong> · UVLFs, stellar mass, star-formation histories</div>
      <div><strong>Outputs</strong> · figures, catalogs, scaling relations</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-media"><img src="images/galaxy-statistics-hero.png" alt="Galaxy statistics during reionisation visual"></div>
</section>
<section class="section fade-in" id="overview">
  <div class="kicker">Overview</div>
  <h2>Scientific context</h2>
  <p class="text">This project gathers the main galaxy population statistics produced by SPICE, linking internal galaxy growth to observable quantities such as UV luminosities, stellar masses, and star-formation histories.</p>
  <p class="text">The goal is to understand what kinds of galaxies dominate the ionising budget and how their observable properties evolve during the reionisation era.</p>
</section>
<section class="section fade-in" id="visuals">
  <div class="kicker">Visual archive</div>
  <h2>Figures and media</h2>
  <div class="media-grid">
    <div>
      <div class="media-frame tall"><img src="images/galaxy-statistics-hero.png" alt="Galaxy statistics during reionisation visual"></div>
      <div class="caption">Representative visual for galaxy population trends.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="media-stack">
      <div>
        <div class="media-frame"><img src="images/galaxy-zoom.png" alt="Galaxy statistics during reionisation visual"></div>
        <div class="caption">Galaxy-centred rendering.</div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="media-frame"><video controls poster="images/project-movie-poster.png"><source src="movies/reionisation-evolution.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video></div>
        <div class="caption">Example movie slot for time evolution or survey-style outputs.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section fade-in" id="results">
  <div class="kicker">Results</div>
  <h2>Key findings</h2>
  <div class="result-list"><div class="result-item"><strong>UV luminosity functions</strong><span class="text">Evolution with redshift and comparison to observed samples.</span></div><div class="result-item"><strong>Stellar mass growth</strong><span class="text">Assembly histories across halo mass and environment.</span></div><div class="result-item"><strong>Star-formation histories</strong><span class="text">Bursty versus smooth growth and the implications for observability.</span></div><div class="result-item"><strong>Galaxy–halo connection</strong><span class="text">Relations between luminosity, mass, and ionising output.</span></div></div>
</section>
<section class="section fade-in" id="links">
  <div class="kicker">Resources</div>
  <h2>Project links</h2>
  <div class="links"><a href="#">Paper</a><a href="#">Associated figures</a><a href="#">Catalog release</a></div>
</section>
</div>
<script>
document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", () => {
  const items = document.querySelectorAll(".fade-in");
  const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
    entries.forEach(entry => { if(entry.isIntersecting) entry.target.classList.add("visible"); });
  }, { threshold: 0.15 });
  items.forEach(item => observer.observe(item));
});
</script>
</body>
</html>
